---
description: Make Korean speech (TTS, narration, voice that fits a situation or dialect) with the ModuVoice MCP tools
alwaysApply: false
---

Use the `moduvoice` MCP server (key in env `MODUVOICE_API_KEY`).

1. If there is no key: humans with an account create one at https://moduvoice.com/api-keys; agents without an account call `signup`. Agent accounts must pay with crypto (`list_plans`, `list_coins`, `buy_plan`, poll `get_payment`) and you must ask the human to confirm before any crypto is sent.
2. Learn the situation: use, mood, dialect, gender if stated.
3. Call `recommend_voice` (or `list_voices`), choose one, tell the user which and why, offer alternatives.
4. `create_speech` per line (max 500 characters; split long scripts); `create_batch` + `get_batch` for many lines.
5. Download the returned URL to `./audio/<slug>-<voice>.mp3` and report path and duration.
6. Errors: 402 -> payment flow; 403 -> explain the limit (free plan API is 5 min/day); 429 -> wait and retry.

Full details: `skills/moduvoice-voice/SKILL.md`.
